# Working documents, kept local: the specs, tickets, the scratch list and internal
# audit reports. Nothing tracked may cite one of these by name — a pointer into a
# gitignored file resolves only in the checkout that happens to hold it, which is why
# `DESIGN.md` and `CONTEXT.md` are NOT here: tracked files cite them from 21 and 16
# sites respectively, including `ADR.md`, `PROTOCOL.md` and `QUIRKS.md`.
# `git add -f <file>` is the whole reversal for anything below.
SPEC_*.md
TICKETS_*.md
TODO.md
findings/

# design-sync: private tooling plus everything `extract-css.mjs` regenerates.
.design-sync/
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/
